        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p>被甲伏怪&amp;Reference[condition=grappled]{擒抱}的生物必須進行一次[[/save ability=con dc=13]]的豁免，豁免失敗則&amp;Reference[condition=poisoned]{中毒}1分鐘。該中毒期間目標生物陷入&amp;Reference[condition=paralyzed]{麻痹}。該目標可以在每個其自己回合結束時再進一次該豁免，豁免成功則終止該效應。</p><p>One creature &amp;Reference[condition=grappled] by the chuul must succeed on a [[/save ability=con dc=13]] saving throw or be &amp;Reference[condition=poisoned] for 1 minute. Until this poison ends, the target is &amp;Reference[condition=paralyzed]. The target can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.</p></div>",
